{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"Web nods. \"The petrification continues, but I can speak and eat now. Small victories are still victories.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:15:09.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740709512612413510","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I have some questions of a more religious nature. They have to do with still-alive Gods, but I figured you would be able to help.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:16:02.251000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740709733765218386","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Indeed, we do appreciate the victories that are provided for us\"\n\n\"Oui, I can help there\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:17:00.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740709979819868160","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I have questions about the deities Osiris, Colombia, and Lolth.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:18:28.102000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740710345508913233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"What would you like to know? Lady Columbia is a warden of this land, like lesser deities of the old world.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:22:36.019000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740711385347915777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Osiris is one from Egypt, an ancient god whose domain remains localized\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:23:31.382000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740711617557168148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Lolth is a lesser deity also like Osiris. They are a ruler of the underdark and the queen of spiders. They are a very powerful being that kills a great many\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:27:07.614000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740712524500173002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Osiris' domain focuses on the process of death, preparing ones for the afterlife and judging one's heart\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:27:51.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740712708361683048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Columbia is of Freedom and Equality, the hope for a future\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:28:14.119000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740712803442229329","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Lolth, thrives in chaos and weaving destiny through its webs, populating it with her children\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:29:01.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740713003565187073","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"For Colombia and Osiris I wish to offer them thanks. It was by them that Baeshra was restored from death. I figured you would know how to appropriately offer them tribute. \nAs for Lolth, the actions of some of the spiders I have come across make me think she has taken an interest in me. I wish to know the implications of that.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:31:11.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740713548061343806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Kiln would probably be the best at preparing a proper thanks, but for Lady Columbia, we can light a bonfire and burn offerings of broken chains or memories of such into the fire. A high place such as those mountains (in hex R).\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:35:11.890000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740714555700936824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"He takes a second to think for Lolth","created_at":"2020-08-05T23:35:18.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740714584255627364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
